@node Buffers
@section Buffers

Majutsu buffers are generated from @samp{jj} output and are read-only.  Each
kind has its own major mode@comma{} derived from @code{majutsu-mode} and through it
from @code{magit-section-mode}.

@multitable {aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa} {aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa}
