@item Bookmark list
@tab Local bookmarks and the state of their remotes
@item Remote list
@tab Git remotes and the bookmarks they hold
@item Tag list
@tab Tags
@item Workspace list
@tab The repository's workspaces
@item Operation log
@tab What happened to the repository
@item Evolution log
