@node Interactive Patching
@section Interactive Patching

Split@comma{} Squash@comma{} Absorb@comma{} and Restore can act on part of a change: selected
hunks@comma{} files@comma{} or lines.  You select in a diff buffer while the command's
transient is open.  The selection belongs to that transient and ends with
it; it is not a staging area.

