@node Understanding Tags
@section Understanding Tags

In Jujutsu@comma{} tags are lightweight refs that point to revisions@comma{} similar to Git
tags. Majutsu wraps @samp{jj tag set/list/delete} and follows jj semantics where
creating and moving tags both use @samp{tag set} (moving requires @samp{--allow-move}).

